{
  "title": "Salawat Abul Hasan al-Zarrab al-Isfahani",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is also necessary not to overlook the famous invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet and the Ahl al-Bayt, peace be upon them, that is ascribed to Abul Hasan al-Zarraab al-Isfahani. Shaykh al-Tusi and Sayyid Ibn Tawus have included this famous invocation with the recommended rites of Friday afternoons. Confirming its significance and writing down the series of its reporters, Sayyid Ibn Tawus adds, “This invocation is reported from our master Imam al-Mahdi, peace be upon him. So, if you have to neglect all the post-prayer litanies on Friday, try not to overlook this invocation for a matter that Almighty Allah has shown to me.”\nAs for Shaykh al-Tusi, he says, “This invocation is reported from the Patron of the Age, Imam al-Mahdi, peace be upon him. It was shown to Abu’l-Hasan al-Zarraab in Makkah.”\nAllowing for summary, the series of reporters will be overlooked. However, the supplication is as follows:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ سَيِّدِ الُمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN SAYYEDIL MURSALEENA\nO God, bless Muhammad, the Master of the Messengers, \nوَ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nWA KHAATAMIN NABIYYEEN \nAnd the Seal of the Prophets, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMENAL \nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds, \nالْمُنْتَجَبِ فِي الْمِيْثَاقِ\nMUNTAJABE FIL MEESAAQIL \nThe Chosen One in the Covenant, \nالْمُصْطَفٰى فِيْ الظِّلَالِ\nMUSTAFAA FIZ ZELAALIL \nThe Selected One in the Shadows (i.e., before creation), \nالْمُطَهَّرِ مِنْ كُلِّ آفَةٍ\nMOTAHHARE MIN KULLE AAAFATIN \nThe Purified One from every defect, \nاَلْبَرِيْءِ مِنْ كُلِّ عَيْبٍ\nAL-BAREE-E MIN KULLE A'YBIN \nThe Free One from every flaw, \nاَلْمُؤَمَّلِ لِلنَّجَاةِ\nAL-MOAMMALE LIN-NAJAATIL \nThe One hoped for salvation, \nالْمُرْتَجٰى لِلشَّفَاعَةِ\nMURTAJAA LISH-SHAFAA-A'TIL\nThe One expected for intercession, \nالْمُفَوَّضِ اِلَيْهِ دِيْنُ اللهِ.\nMOFAWWAZE ELAYHE DEENUL LAAHE.\nThe One entrusted with the religion of God.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ شَرِّفْ بُنْيَانَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA SHARRIF BUNYAANAHU \nO Allah, dignify his stature/rank,\nوَ عَظِّمْ بُرْهَانَهٗ\nWA A'ZZIM BURHAANAHU\nAnd magnify his Proof \nوَ اَفْلِحْ حُجَّتَهٗ\nWA AFLIJ HUJJATAHU \nAnd make his Argument victorious,\nوَ ارْفَعْ دَرَجَتَهٗ\nWAR FA' DARAJATAHU\nAnd raise his degree (rank), \nوَ اَضِءْ نُوْرَهٗ\nWA AZE-A NOORAHU\nAnd illuminate his light, \nوَ بَيِّضْ وَجْهَهٗ\nWA BAYYIZ WAJHAHU\nAnd brighten his face, \nوَ اَعْطِهِ الْفَضْلَ وَ الْفَضِيْلَةَ\nWA AA'-TEHIL FAZLA WAL FAZEELATA\nAnd grant him the merit and the Pre-eminence,\nوَ الْمَنْزِلَةَ وَ الْوَسِيْلَةَ\nWAL MANZELATA WAL WASEELATA\nAnd the Rank and the Means, \nوَ الدَّرَجَةَ الرَّفِيْعَةَ\nWAD DARAJATAR RAFEE-A'TA\nAnd the Exalted Rank, \nوَ ابْعَثْهُ مَقَامًا مَحْمُوْدًا\nWAB A'SHO MAQAAMAM MAHMOODAN\nAnd raise him to the Praised Station,\nيَغْبِطُهٗ بِهِ الْاَوَّلُوْنَ وَ الْآخِرُوْنَ\nYAGHBETOHU BEHIL AWWALOONA WAL AAAKHEROONA\nWhich the first and the last ones envy him for.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nWA SALLE A'LAA AMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nAnd bless the Commander of the Faithful, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ قَائِدِ الْغُرِّ الُمحَجَّليْنَ\nWA QAA-EDIL GHURRIL MOHAJJALEENA \nAnd the Leader of the Bright-faced Ones, \nوَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ\nWA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA \nAnd the Master of the Successors, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A'LAL HASAN IBNE A'LIYYIN \nAnd bless al-Hasan ibn Ali, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى الْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A'LAL HUSAYN IBNE A'LAYYIN \nAnd bless al-Husayn ibn Ali, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ\nWA SALLE A'LAA A'LIYY IBNIL HUSAYN\nAnd bless Ali ibn al-Husayn, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA\nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَليْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMAD IBNE A'LIYYIN\nAnd bless Muhammad ibn Ali, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA\nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَحُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLE A'LAA JA'-FAR IBNE MOHAMMADIN\nAnd bless Ja'far ibn Muhammad, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA\nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ\nWA SALLE A'LAA MOOSAB NE JA'FARIN\nAnd bless Musa ibn Ja’far, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA \nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُوْسٰى\nWA SALLE A'LAA A'LIYY IBNE MOOSAA \nAnd bless Ali ibn Moosa, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA\nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMAD IBNE A'LIYYIN \nAnd bless Muhammad ibn Ali, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA \nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLE A'LAA A'LIYY IBNE MOHAMMADIN \nAnd bless Ali ibn Muhammad, \nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA \nAnd the Heir of the Messengers, \nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A'ALAL HASAN IBNE A'LIYYIN \nAnd bless al-Hasan ibn Ali,\nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers, \nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA \nAnd the Heir of the Messengers,\nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلَى الْخَلَفِ الْهَادِيْ الْمَهْدِيِّ\nWA SALLE A'LAL KHALAFIL HAADIL MAHDIYYE \nAnd bless the Successor, the Guiding, the Guided,\nاِمَامِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nEMAAMIL MOAMENEENA \nThe Imam of the Believers,\nوَ وَارِثِ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA WAARESIL MURSALEENA \nAnd the Heir of the Messengers,\nوَ حُجَّةِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ،\nWA HUJJATE RABBIL A'ALAMEENA.\nAnd the Proof of the Lord of the Worlds.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AHLE BAYTEHIL \nO Allah, bless Muhammad and the People of his Household,\nالْاَئِمَّةِ الْهَادِيْنَ\nA-IMMATIL HAADEENAL \nThe Guiding Imams, \nالْعُلَمَاءِ الصَّادِقِيْنَ\nO'LAMAAA-IS SAADEQEENAL \nThe Truthful Scholars, \nالْاَبْرَارِ الْمُتَّقِيْنَ\nABRAARIL MUTTAQEENA \nThe Pious Righteous Ones, \nدَعَائِمِ دِيْنِكَ\nDA-A'AA-EME DEENEKA \nThe Pillars of Your Religion, \nوَ اَرْكَانِ تَوْحِيْدِكَ\nWA ARKAANE TAWHEEDEKA \nAnd the Foundations of Your Monotheism, \nوَ تَرَاجِمَةِ وَحْيِكَ\nWA TARAAJEMATE WAH-YEKA \nAnd the Interpreters of Your Revelation, \nوَ حُجَجِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ\nWA HOJAJEKA A'LAA KHALQEKA \nAnd Your Proofs over Your creation, \nوَ خُلَفَائِكَ فِىْ اَرْضِكَ\nWA KHOLAFAA-EKA FEE ARZEKAL \nAnd Your Successors upon Your earth, \nالَّذِيْنَ اخْتَرْتَهُمْ لِنَفْسِكَ\nLAZEENAKH TARTAHUM LE-NAFSEKA \nThose whom You chose for Yourself, \nوَ اصْطَفَيْتَهُمْ عَلٰى عِبَادِكَ\nWAS TAFAYTAHUM A'LAA E'BAADEKA\nAnd You selected over Your servants, \nوَ ارْتَضَيْتَهُمْ لِدِيْنِكَ\nWAR TAZAYTAHUM LE-DEENEKA \nAnd You approved for Your religion, \nوَ خَصَصْتَهُمْ بِمَعْرِفَتِكَ\nWA KHASASTAHUM BE-MAA'REFATEKA \nAnd You singled out with Your gnosis (knowledge), \nوَ جَلَّلْتَهُمْ بِكَرَامَتِكَ\nWA JALLALTAHUM BE-KARAAMATEKA \nAnd You covered with Your generosity, \nوَ غَشَّيْتَهُمْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ\nWA GHASHSHAYTAHUM BE-RAHMATEKA \nAnd You enveloped with Your mercy,\nوَ رَبَّيْتَهُمْ بِنِعْمَتِكَ\nWA RABBAYTAHUM BE-NE'-MATEKA \nAnd You raised them with Your favour, \nوَ غَذَّيْتَهُمْ بِحِكْمَتِكَ\nWA GHAZZAYTAHUM BE-HIKMATEKA \nAnd You nourished them with Your wisdom, \nوَ اَلْبَسْتَهُمْ نُوْرَكَ\nWA ALBASTAHUM NOORAKA\nAnd You clothed them with Your light, \nوَ رَفَعْتَهُمْ فِىْ مَلَكُوْتِكَ\nWA RAFA'-TAHUM FEE MALAKOOTEKA \nAnd You raised them in Your kingdom, \nوَ حَفَفْتَهُمْ بِمَلَائِكَتِكَ\nWA HAFAFTAHUM BE-MALAAAEKATEKA \nAnd You surrounded them with Your angels, \nوَ شَرَّفْتَهُمْ بِنَبِيِّكَ\nWA SHARRAFTAHUM BE-NABIYYEKA \nAnd You honoured them through Your Prophet, \nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهٖ.\nSALAWAATOKA A'LAYHE WA AALEHI.\nYour blessings be upon him and his family.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ عَلَيْهِمْ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADINW WA A'LAYHIM \nO Allah, bless Muhammad and them (the Imams), \nصَلَاةً  زَاكِيَةً نَامِيَةً كَثِيْرَةً\nSALAATAN ZAAKEYATAN NAAMEYATAN KASEERATAN \nA blessing that is pure, ever-growing, Abundant,\nدَائِمَةً طَيِّبَةً\nDAA-EMATAN TAYYEBATAN\ncontinuous, goodly, \nلَا يُحِيْطُ بِهَا اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nLAA YOHEETO BEHAA ILLAA ANTA\nWhich none can encompass except You,\nوَ لَا يَسَعُهَا اِلَّا عِلْمُكَ\nWA LAA YASA-O'HAA ILLAA I'LMOKA\nAnd none can contain except Your knowledge, \nوَ لَا يُحْصِيْهَا اَحَدٌ غَيْرُكَ.\nWA LAA YOHSEEHAA AHADUN GHAYROKA.\nAnd none can count except You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ صَلِّ عَلٰى وَلِيِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA SALLE A'LAA WALIYYEKAL \nO Allah, and bless Your Guardian,\nالْمُحْيِيْ سُنَّتَكَ\nMOH-YEE SUNNATAKAL \nThe Reviver of Your Sunnah,\nاَلْقَائِمِ بِاَمْرِكَ\nQAAA-EME BE-AMREKAD \nThe Establisher of Your Command, \nاَلدَّاعِىْ اِلَيْكَ\nDAA-E'E ELAYKAD \nThe Caller towards You, \nالدَّلِيْلِ عَلَيْكَ،\nDALEELE A'LAYKA.\nThe Guide to You.\nحُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ\nHUJJATEKA A'LAA KHALQEKA \nYour Proof over Your creation, \nوَ خَلِيْفَتِكَ فِيْ اَرْضِكَ\nWA KHALEEFATEKA FEE ARZEKA \nAnd Your Caliph (Successor) in Your earth, \nوَ شَاهِدِكَ عَلٰى عِبَادِكَ.\nWA SHAAHEDEKA A'LAA E'BAADEKA.\nAnd Your Witness over Your servants.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعِزَّ نَصْرَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA A-I'ZZA NASRAHU\nO Allah, give strength to his victory, \nوَ مُدَّ فِىْ عُمْرِهٖ\nWA MUDDA FEE U'MREHI\nAnd extend his life, \nوَ زَيِّنِ الْاَرْضَ بِطُوْلِ بَقَائِهٖ.\nWA ZAYYENIL ARZA BE-TOOLE BAQAAA-EHI.\nAnd adorn the earth with the length of his remaining.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اكْفِهٖ بَغْيَ الْحَاسِدِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMAK FEHI BAGHYAL HAASEDEENA \nO Allah, suffice him against the malice of the envious,\nوَ اَعِذْهُ مِنْ شَرِّ الْكَائِدِيْنَ\nWA A-I'ZHO MIN SHARRIL KAA-EDEENA \nAnd protect him from the evil of the conspirators, \nوَ ازْجُرْ عَنْهُ اِرَادَةَ الظَّالِمِيْنَ\nWAZ JUR A'NHO ERAADATAZ ZAALEMEENA \nAnd restrain from him the intentions of the oppressors, \nوَ خَلِّصْهُ مِنْ اَيْدِي الْجَبَّارِيْنَ.\nWA KHALLIS-HO MIN AYDIL JABBAAREENA.\nAnd deliver him from the hands of the tyrants.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعْطِهٖ فِيْ نَفْسِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMAA AA'-TEHI FEE NAFSEHI\nO Allah, grant him in himself \nوَ ذُرِّيَّتِهٖ وَ شِيْعَتِهٖ\nWA ZURRIYYATEHI WA SHEE-ATEHI\nand his offspring, And his followers \nوَ رَعِيَّتِهٖ وَ خاصَّتِهٖ\nWA RA-I'YYATEHI WA KHAASSATEHI\nand his subjects, And his close ones \nوَ عَامَّتِهٖ وَ عَدُوِّهٖ\nWA A'AMMATEHI WA A'DUWWEHI\nand his general followers, And his enemy \nوَ جَمِيْعِ اَهْلِ الدُّنْيَا\nWA JAMEE-E' AHLID DUNYAA \nand all the people of the world, \nمَا تُقِرُّ بِهٖ عَيْنَهٗ\nMAA TOQIRRO BEHI A'YNAHU \nThat which delights his eye, \nوَ تَسُرُّ بِهٖ نَفْسَهٗ\nWA TASURRO BEHI NAFSAHU \nAnd pleases his soul, \nوَ بَلِّغْهُ اَفْضَلَ مَا اَمَّلَهٗ\nWA BALLIGH-HO AFZALA MAA AMMALAHU \nAnd let him attain the best of what he has hoped for, \nفِيْ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْآخِرَةِ\nFID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE \nin this world and the Hereafter.\nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ.\nINNAKA A'LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN.\nIndeed, You are over all things Capable.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ جَدِّدْ بِهٖ مَا اْمَتَحٰى مِنْ دِيْنِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA JADDID BEHI MAM TAHAA MIN DEENEKA \nO Allah, renew through him what has been effaced from Your religion,\nوَ اَحْيِ بِهٖ مَا بُدِّلَ مِنْ كِتابِكَ\nWA AHYE BEHI MAA BUDDELA MIN KETAABEKA\nRevive through him what has been altered in Your Book, \nوَ اَظْهِرْ بِهٖ مَا غُيِّرَ مِنْ حُكْمِكَ\nWA AZHIR BEHI MAA GHUYYERA MIN HUKMEKA\nAnd manifest through him what has been changed in Your ruling,\nحَتّٰى يَعُوْدَ دِيْنُكَ بِهٖ\nHATTAA YA-O'ODA DEENOKA BEHI \nUntil Your religion returns through him \nوَ عَلٰى يَدَيْهِ غَضًّا جَدِيْدًا\nWA A'LAA YADAYHE GHAZZAN JADEEDAN\nand by his hands, Fresh, new, \nخَالِصًا مُخْلَصًا\nKHAALESAN MUKHLASAN \nPure, sincere, \nلَا شَكَّ فِيْهِ وَ لَا شُبْهَةَ مَعَهٗ\nLAA SHAKKA FEEHE WA LAA SHUBATA MA-A'HU \nWith no doubt in it, and no ambiguity accompanying it, \nوَ لَا بَاطِلَ عِنْدَهٗ\nWA LAA BAATELA I'NDAHU \nWith no falsehood near it, \nوَ لَا بِدْعَةَ لَدَيْهِ.\nWA LAA BID-A’TA LADAYHE.\nand no innovation within it.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ نَوِّرْ بِنُوْرِهٖ كُلَّ ظُلْمَةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA NAWWIR BE-NOOREHI KULLA ZULMATIN \nO Allah, illuminate with his light every darkness, \nوَ هُدَّ بِرُكْنِهٖ كُلَّ بِدْعَةٍ\nWA HUDDA BE-RUKNEHI KULLA BIDA’TIN\nAnd destroy with his strength every innovation,\nوَ اهْدِمْ بِعِزِّهٖ كُلَّ ضَلَالَةٍ\nWAH DIM BE-I'ZZEHI KULLA ZALAALATIN \nAnd demolish with his might every misguidance, \nوَ اقْصِمْ بِهٖ كُلَّ جَبَّارٍ\nWAQ SIM BEHI KULLA JABBAARIN \nAnd crush through him every tyrant, \nوَ اَخْمِدْ بِسَيْفِهٖ كُلَّ نَارٍ\nWA AKHMID BE-SAYFEHI KULLAA NAARIN\nAnd extinguish with his sword every fire, \nوَ اَهْلِكْ بِعَدْلِهٖ جَوْرَ كُلِّ جَائِرٍ\nWA AHLIK BE-A'DLEHI JAWRA KULLE JAA-ERIN \nAnd destroy with his justice the oppression of every wrongdoer, \nوَ اجْرِ حُكْمَهٗ عَلٰى كُلِّ حُكْمٍ\nWAJ RE HUKMAHU A'LAA KULLE HUKMIN\nAnd enforce his rule over every rule, \nوَ اَذِلَّ بِسُلْطَانِهٖ كُلَّ سُلْطَانٍ.\nWA AZILLA BE-SULTAANEHI KULLA SULTAANIN.\nAnd humiliate with his authority every authority.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَذِلَّ كُلَّ مَنْ نَاوَاهُ\nALLAAHUMMA AZILLA KULLA MAN NAAWAAHO \nO Allah, humiliate everyone who opposes him, \nوَ اَهْلِكْ كُلَّ مَنْ عَادَاهُ\nWA AHLIK KULLA MAN A'ADAAHO\nAnd destroy everyone who is hostile to him,\nوَ امْكُرْ بِمَنْ كَادَهٗ\nWAM KUR BEMAN KAADAHU \nAnd plot against those who scheme against him,\nوَ اسْتَاْصِلْ مَنْ جَحَدَهٗ حَقَّهٗ\nWAS TAASIL MAN JAHADAHU HAQQAHU \nAnd uproot those who deny his right, \nوَ اسْتَهَانَ بِاَمْرِهٖ\nWAS TAHAANA BE-AMREHI\nAnd belittle his command, \nوَ سَعٰى فِيْ اِطْفَاءِ نُوْرِهٖ\nWA SA-A'A FEE ITFAA-E NOOREHI\nAnd strive to extinguish his light, \nوَ اَرَادَ اِخْمَادَ ذِكْرِهٖ.\nWA ARAADA IKHMAADA ZIKHREHI.\nAnd desire to suppress his mention.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍۨ الْمُصْطَفٰى\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A'LAA MOHAMMADENIL MUSTAFAA\nO Allah, bless Muhammad, the Chosen, \nوَ عَلِيٍّ۟ الْمُرْتَضٰى\nWA A'LIYYENIL MURTAZAA \nAnd Ali, the Well-pleased,\nوَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَاءِ\nWA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAA-E \nAnd Fatima, the Radiant,\nوَ الْحَسَنِ الرِّضَا\nWAL HASANIR REZEAA \nAnd al-Hasan, the Content,\nوَ الْحُسَيْنِ الْمُصَفّٰى\nWAL HUSAYNIL MOSAFFAA \nAnd al-Husayn, the Purified,\nوَ جَمِيْعِ الْاَوْصِيَاءِ\nWA JAMEE-I'L AWSEYAA-E \nAnd all the Successors, \nمَصَابِيْحِ الدُّجٰى\nMASAABEEHID DOJAA \nthe Lamps in the darkness, \nوَ اَعْلَامِ الْهُدٰى\nWA A'ALAAMIL HODAA \nAnd the Banners of Guidance, \nوَ مَنَارِ التُّقٰى\nWA MANAARIT TOQAA\nAnd the Lighthouses of Piety, \nوَ الْعُرْوَةِ الْوُثْقٰى\nWAL U'RWATIL WUSQAA \nAnd the Firmest Handle, \nوَ الْحَبْلِ الْمَتِيْنِ\nWAL HABLIL MATEENE \nAnd the Strong Cord, \nوَ الصِّرَاطِ الْمُسْتَقِيْمِ،\nWAS SERAATIL MUSTAQEEM.\nAnd the Straight Path.\nوَ صَلِّ عَلٰى وَلِيِّكَ\nWA SALLE A'LAA WALIYYEKA \nAnd bless Your Guardian \nوَ وُلَاةِ عَهْدِكَ\nWA WOLAATE A'HDEKA \nand the Custodians of Your Covenant, \nوَ الْاَئِمَّةِ مِنْ وُلْدِهٖ\nWAL A-IMMATE MIN WULDEHI\nAnd the Imams from his progeny, \nوَ مُدَّ فِيْ اَعْمَارِهِمْ\nWA MUDDA FEE AA'-MAAREHIM \nAnd extend their lives, \nوَ زِدْ فِيْ آجَالِهِمْ\nWA ZID FEE AAAJAALEHIM\nAnd increase their appointed terms, \nوَ بَلِّغْهُمْ اَقْصٰى آمَالِهِمْ\nWA BALLIGH-HUM AQSAA AAAMAALEHIM \nAnd let them attain the furthest of their hopes, \nدِيْنًا وَ دُنْيَا وَ آخِرَةً\nDEENAN WA DUNYAA WA AAAKHERATAN\nRegarding religion, world, and the Hereafter.\nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ .\nINNAKA A'LAA KULLE SHAYIN QADEERUN.\nIndeed, You have power over all things.\nAccording to some narrations, the Saturday nights are as sacred as Friday nights; therefore, it is recommendably required to say the same supplications of Friday night at Saturday nights."
}
